<section class="section soft" id="join"><div class="wrap join-grid"><div><div class="section-head"><div class="kicker">Get involved</div><h2>Be part of the MOYA journey.</h2><p>Are you a young person from Madi Opei or someone who believes in the potential of our community? Connect with the association and express your interest in membership, volunteering or partnership.</p></div>
<h3 style="color:var(--deep)">Together, we can:</h3><ul class="muted"><li>Build stronger connections among young people.</li><li>Support positive community initiatives.</li><li>Develop leadership and responsibility.</li><li>Create opportunities through collaboration.</li></ul></div>
<form class="formbox" id="memberForm"><h3 style="margin:0;color:var(--deep)">Express membership interest</h3><p class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin:5px 0 12px">Send your details to the MOYA contact through WhatsApp.</p>
